}

docs {
  ## List Jobs — Public
  
  Returns a paginated list of active jobs with owner and category relations.
  
  ### Query Parameters
  | Parameter  | Type    | Description                                      |
  |-----------|---------|--------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number  | Page number (default: 1)                         |
  | limit     | number  | Items per page (default: 50, max: 1000)          |
  | sortBy    | string  | Sort field: `created_at`, `updated_at`, `title`, `views`, `deadline`, `budget` |
  | sortOrder | string  | `asc` or `desc`                                  |
  | category  | string  | Filter by category UUID                          |
  | owner     | string  | Filter by owner UUID                             |
  | search    | string  | Search in title and description                  |
  | tags      | string  | Comma-separated tag filter                       |
  | type      | string  | Filter by job type (PARTTIME, FULLTIME, etc.)    |
  | status    | string  | Filter by status (default: ACTIVE)               |
  
  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [  {
          "id": "8684bfa0-4432-4f04-8366-a52a1539cf2d",
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T20:44:43.297452+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T20:44:43.297452+00:00",
          "status": "ACTIVE",
          "owner": {
            "id": "b1c04e60-f07d-4769-bd7f-8688181da6b6",
            "name": "Abir Hasan",
            "avatar": null,
            "username": "hasan-773892",
            "verified": false,
            "department": "2acbc219-42d9-4d18-83e1-40fabf13fcdc"
          },
          "category": {
            "id": "fa6dedc2-277e-43bf-a20c-c7aae7cf0ccd",
            "name": "Web Development",
            "slug": "web-development"
          },
          "title": "Looking for a full-stack developer",
          "slug": "looking-for-a-fullstack-developer-260706024443",
          "description": "We are looking for an experienced full-stack developer to build a modern web application using React and Node.js.",
          "attachments": [
            "https://example.com/job-description.pdf"
          ],
          "type": "FULLTIME",
          "budget": "$3000 - $5000",
          "deadline": "2026-08-15T00:00:00+00:00",
          "location": "Remote",
          "required_skills": [
            "React",
            "Node.js",
            "TypeScript",
            "PostgreSQL"
          ],
          "tags": [
